{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#card-zh","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-approval 是一个面向 DSH 的工具调用人工审批插件。它在 tools/pre-execute 阶段拦截工具执行，并对符合配置规则的调用返回审批请求；默认所有工具都需要审批，也可用 include、exclude 通配符筛选工具，并设置提示原因。适合希望在工具运行前逐次确认的 DSH 用户。无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-69","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#card-en","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-approval adds manual approval to DSH tool calls. At the tools/pre-execute hook, it asks for approval when a tool name matches configurable include patterns and is not excluded. All tools are gated by default. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-69","cordis.patch.yml:1-3"]}
