{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#feature-1","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-approval 的功能「通用工具调用审批」：插件在 tools/pre-execute 钩子检查工具名称，匹配 include 且未匹配 exclude 时返回 ask 决策，要求审批后再执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:62-68"]}
{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#feature-2","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-approval 的功能「工具名称筛选」：include 和 exclude 支持 * 通配符，可按工具名称选择哪些调用需要审批、哪些直接通过。默认 include 为 *，exclude 为空。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:22-40"]}
{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#feature-3","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-approval 的功能「自定义审批说明」：可配置 reason 字符串，作为每次审批请求附带的说明；默认文本为 tool execution requires your approval。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:42-46","src/index.ts:56-60"]}
