{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#readme-3","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-approval README · Default config：```yml\n- id: tool-approval\n  name: dsh-tool-approval\n```\n\nWith the default config, every Tool Calling goes through pre-approval.","source":"extracted","section":"Default config"}
{"unit_id":"ilharp__dsh-tool-approval#readme-4","repo":"ilharp/dsh-tool-approval","commit":"c01801a7e39c36515d8445747abff6a6388c1278","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-approval README · Custom config：```yml\n- id: tool-approval\n  name: dsh-tool-approval\n  config:\n    include: [fs_*, web_*]\n\nOnly tools specified in `include` get pre-approval; tools in `exclude` pass through. Wildcards are supported.","source":"extracted","section":"Custom config"}
